nd="00:34.970">on </span><span begin="00:34.970" end="00:35.180">your </span><span begin="00:35.180" end="00:37.340">coat</span><span begin="00:37.340" end="00:37.400">, </span><span begin="00:37.400" end="00:38.000">and </span><span begin="00:38.000" end="00:39.320">smile</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.350" end="00:45.170"><span begin="00:39.350" end="00:40.340">Saddest </span><span begin="00:40.340" end="00:40.730">one </span><span begin="00:40.730" end="00:40.850">I've </span><span begin="00:40.850" end="00:41.600">see </span><span begin="00:41.600" end="00:41.630"> </span><span begin="00:41.630" end="00:42.170">for </span><span begin="00:42.170" end="00:42.290">a </span><span begin="00:42.290" end="00:43.250">country </span><span begin="00:43.250" end="00:45.140">mile</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.170" end="00:50.600"><span begin="00:45.170" end="00:45.800">Brought </span><span begin="00:45.800" end="00:45.980">it </span><span begin="00:45.980" end="00:46.430">down </span><span begin="00:46.430" end="00:46.670">the </span><span begin="00:46.670" end="00:48.680">road</span><span begin="00:48.680" end="00:48.710">, </span><span begin="00:48.710" end="00:49.310">quick </span><span begin="00:49.310" end="00:50.570">smart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.600" end="00:56.630"><span begin="00:50.600" end="00:51.050">There's </span><span begin="00:51.050" end="00:51.620">always </span><span begin="00:51.620" end="00:52.370">****ing </span><span begin="00:52.370" end="00:53.270">rain </span><span begin="00:53.270" end="00:53.600">and </span><span begin="00:53.600" end="00:53.900">it's </span><span begin="00:53.900" end="00:54.950">always </span><span begin="00:54.950" end="00:56.300">dark</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.630" end="01:02.330"><span begin="00:56.630" end="00:57.050">You </span><span begin="00:57.050" end="00:57.530">were </span><span begin="00:57.530" end="00:57.770">at </span><span begin="00:57.770" end="00:58.070">the </span><span begin="00:58.070" end="00:59.690">gate</span><span begin="00:59.690" end="00:59.990">, </span><span begin="00:59.990" end="01:00.890">soaked </span><span begin="01:00.890" end="01:02.300">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.330" end="01:07.190"><span begin="01:02.330" end="01:02.840">Let's </span><span begin="01:02.840" end="01:03.080">not </span><span begin="01:03.080" end="01:03.620">say </span><span begin="01:03.620" end="01:03.770">a </span><span begin="01:03.770" end="01:04.670">word </span><span begin="01:04.670" end="01:05.000">if </span><span begin="01:05.000" end="01:05.420">it </span><span begin="01:05.420" end="01:06.200">isn't </span><span begin="01:06.200" end="01:07.190">true</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.190" end="01:07.610"><span begin="01:07.190" end="01:07.610">Bloomsday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.610" end="01:08.240"><span begin="01:07.610" end="01:08.240">Bloomsday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.240" end="01:08.780"><span begin="01:08.240" end="01:08.780">Bloomsday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.780" end="01:42.830"><span begin="01:08.780" end="01:11.420">Bloomsday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.830" end="01:48.050"><span begin="01:42.830" end="01:43.190">Cordon </span><span begin="01:43.190" end="01:43.520">off </span><span begin="01:43.520" end="01:43.730">the </span><span begin="01:43.730" end="01:45.800">rest</span><span begin="01:45.800" end="01:45.830">, </span><span begin="01:45.830" end="01:46.610">too </span><span begin="01:46.610" end="01:47.990">young</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.050" end="01:53.810"><span begin="01:48.050" end="01:48.740">Looking </span><span begin="01:48.740" end="01:49.340">for </span><span begin="01:49.340" end="01:49.430">a </span><span begin="01:49.430" end="01:50.240">thing </span><span begin="01:50.240" end="01:50.990">no </span><span begin="01:50.990" end="01:52.040">doer's </span><span begin="01:52.040" end="01:53.600">done</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.810" end="01:59.450"><span begin="01:53.810" end="01:54.200">We </span><span begin="01:54.200" end="01:54.530">won't </span><span begin="01:54.530" end="01:55.070">find </span><span begin="01:55.070" end="01:55.250">it </span><span begin="01:55.250" end="01:57.320">here</span><span begin="01:57.320" end="01:57.350">, </span><span begin="01:57.350" end="01:58.250">my </span><span begin="01:58.250" end="01:59.420">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.450" end="02:05.030"><span begin="01:59.450" end="02:00.290">Drinking </span><span begin="02:00.290" end="02:00.650">with </span><span begin="02:00.650" end="02:00.890">the </span><span begin="02:00.890" end="02:02.180">Taurus </span><span begin="02:02.180" end="02:02.330">and </span><span begin="02:02.330" end="02:03.230">filing </span><span begin="02:03.230" end="02:03.380">in </span><span begin="02:03.380" end="02:04.250">front </span><span begin="02:04.250" end="02:04.700">of </span><span begin="02:04.700" end="02:05.030">'em</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.030" end="02:10.970"><span begin="02:05.030" end="02:05.510">Oh </span><span begin="02:05.510" end="02:05.960">to </span><span begin="02:05.960" end="02:06.260">be </span><span begin="02:06.260" end="02:08.660">young</span><span begin="02:08.660" end="02:08.690">, </span><span begin="02:08.690" end="02:09.530">once </span><span begin="02:09.530" end="02:10.910">more</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.970" end="02:16.370"><span begin="02:10.970" end="02:11.420">I </span><span begin="02:11.420" end="02:11.840">know </span><span begin="02:11.840" end="02:12.140">all </span><span begin="02:12.140" end="02:12.410">the </span><span begin="02:12.410" end="02:13.220">lines </span><span begin="02:13.220" end="02:13.610">lived </span><span begin="02:13.610" end="02:13.910">it </span><span begin="02:13.910" end="02:14.240">all </span><span begin="02:14.240" end="02:16.340">before</span></p><p ttm:agent="